00:00:00.00>%0 ADDWPT 16.057809,108.201338 0 0.0
00:00:00.00>%0 ADDWPT 16.057850,108.201800 0 5.0
00:00:00.00>%0 LNAV ON
00:00:00.00>%0 VNAV ON
00:00:00.00>%0 SPD 8.0
